  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "pumel_meeting_open",
      "speaker": "pumel",
      "kind": "meeting",
      "text": "Careful where you put your elbow. Everything on this bench is either a cup or my lunch, and I am fond of both. I'm Pumel.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "not_flag": "met_pumel"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [
        {
          "set_flag": "met_pumel",
          "value": true
        }
      ],
      "next": "pumel_meeting_question"
    },
    {
      "id": "pumel_meeting_question",
      "speaker": "pumel",
      "kind": "meeting",
      "text": "I came from the Mineral Springs Terraces with a crate of pots. What would you look for in a cup?",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_pumel"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "A shape that feels good to hold.",
          "next": "pumel_meeting_value_1"
        },
        {
          "text": "A lovely color.",
          "next": "pumel_meeting_value_2"
        },
        {
          "text": "One that won't tip over.",
          "next": "pumel_meeting_value_3"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pumel_meeting_value_1",
      "speaker": "pumel",
      "kind": "meeting",
      "text": "Ah, a sensible pair of paws. I make the handle first when I can. It reminds the rest of the cup whom it is for.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_pumel"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "next": "pumel_meeting_close"
    },
    {
      "id": "pumel_meeting_value_2",
      "speaker": "pumel",
      "kind": "meeting",
      "text": "Then let us turn it toward the light. A glaze can keep a little pool of color even when the cup is empty.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_pumel"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "next": "pumel_meeting_close"
    },
    {
      "id": "pumel_meeting_value_3",
      "speaker": "pumel",
      "kind": "meeting",
      "text": "Exactly. I made a very handsome cup that disagreed with the table. We are negotiating a broader base.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_pumel"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "next": "pumel_meeting_close"
    },
    {
      "id": "pumel_meeting_close",
      "speaker": "pumel",
      "kind": "meeting",
      "text": "You are welcome at the potter's bench. Opinions fit on the shelf too, provided we leave room for the cups.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_pumel"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "pumel_greeting_dawn_clear",
      "speaker": "pumel",
      "kind": "greeting",
      "text": "Morning light makes this clay look like warm bread. I have labeled my lunch, just in case.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_pumel"
        },
        {
          "time": "dawn"
        },
        {
          "weather": "clear"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "pumel_greeting_dawn_rain",
      "speaker": "pumel",
      "kind": "greeting",
      "text": "Rain before breakfast. The roof does the tapping, and I can give my fingers a rest.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_pumel"
        },
        {
          "time": "dawn"
        },
        {
          "weather": "rain"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "pumel_greeting_day_clear",
      "speaker": "pumel",
      "kind": "greeting",
      "text": "Come feel this smooth edge with your eyes. The glaze is finished, but I still enjoy being fussy about it.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_pumel"
        },
        {
          "time": "day"
        },
        {
          "weather": "clear"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "pumel_greeting_day_rain",
      "speaker": "pumel",
      "kind": "greeting",
      "text": "A rainy day gives every pot on the sill its own little reflection. Mine is the roundest.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_pumel"
        },
        {
          "time": "day"
        },
        {
          "weather": "rain"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "pumel_greeting_dusk_clear",
      "speaker": "pumel",
      "kind": "greeting",
      "text": "The cream glaze goes rosy at dusk. I would bottle the color if I could find a bottle that deserved it.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_pumel"
        },
        {
          "time": "dusk"
        },
        {
          "weather": "clear"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "pumel_greeting_dusk_rain",
      "speaker": "pumel",
      "kind": "greeting",
      "text": "Dusk already? I have been matching the glaze to that wet stone. The stone keeps changing its mind.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_pumel"
        },
        {
          "time": "dusk"
        },
        {
          "weather": "rain"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "pumel_greeting_night_clear",
      "speaker": "pumel",
      "kind": "greeting",
      "text": "The bench is quiet tonight. Sit if you like. I have moved the jar that used to occupy the best seat.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_pumel"
        },
        {
          "time": "night"
        },
        {
          "weather": "clear"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "pumel_greeting_night_rain",
      "speaker": "pumel",
      "kind": "greeting",
      "text": "Rain on the awning, warm cup in the hands. That is a very well-balanced arrangement.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_pumel"
        },
        {
          "time": "night"
        },
        {
          "weather": "rain"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "pumel_quest_offer",
      "speaker": "pumel",
      "kind": "quest",
      "text": "This cup tips too easily. Will you try a broader base on the stable display ledge, then help me choose a finish?",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_pumel"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "q_pumel_done"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "q_pumel_accepted"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Let's give it a steadier base.",
          "next": "pumel_quest_accept"
        },
        {
          "text": "I'll visit the bench another time.",
          "next": "pumel_quest_defer"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pumel_quest_accept",
      "speaker": "pumel",
      "kind": "quest",
      "text": "Meet me at the potter's bench. We will look at the ledge together before trying the cup.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_pumel"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "q_pumel_done"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "q_pumel_accepted"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [
        {
          "set_flag": "q_pumel_accepted",
          "value": true
        }
      ],
      "next": "pumel_quest_travel_wait"
    },
    {
      "id": "pumel_quest_defer",
      "speaker": "pumel",
      "kind": "quest",
      "text": "Certainly. Clay has taught me several kinds of waiting. This is one of the easy ones.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_pumel"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "q_pumel_done"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "q_pumel_accepted"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "pumel_quest_travel_wait",
      "speaker": "pumel",
      "kind": "quest",
      "text": "Find the potter's bench when it suits you. The broad base is waiting beside the display ledge.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_pumel"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "q_pumel_done"
        },
        {
          "flag": "q_pumel_accepted"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "q_pumel_prepared"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "pumel_quest_prepare",
      "speaker": "pumel",
      "kind": "quest",
      "text": "Here is the broad base, and there is the stable ledge. Shall we try it there and choose a finish together?",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_pumel"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "q_pumel_done"
        },
        {
          "flag": "q_pumel_accepted"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "q_pumel_prepared"
        },
        {
          "visited": "potters_bench"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Yes. Let's try it on the ledge.",
          "next": "pumel_quest_prepared"
        },
        {
          "text": "What finishes can we choose?",
          "next": "pumel_quest_detail"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pumel_quest_detail",
      "speaker": "pumel",
      "kind": "quest",
      "text": "Cream or ochre, whichever you like. One holds the light gently; the other reminds me of home. Neither makes a steadier cup.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_pumel"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "q_pumel_done"
        },
        {
          "flag": "q_pumel_accepted"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "q_pumel_prepared"
        },
        {
          "visited": "potters_bench"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Yes. Let's try it on the ledge.",
          "next": "pumel_quest_prepared"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pumel_quest_prepared",
      "speaker": "pumel",
      "kind": "quest",
      "text": "Try the broad base on the stable display ledge, then choose the finish with me. We need both before I call it ready.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_pumel"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "q_pumel_done"
        },
        {
          "flag": "q_pumel_accepted"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "q_pumel_prepared"
        },
        {
          "visited": "potters_bench"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [
        {
          "set_flag": "q_pumel_prepared",
          "value": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pumel_quest_event_wait",
      "speaker": "pumel",
      "kind": "quest",
      "text": "Once the broad base has been tried on the stable ledge and its finish is chosen, we can admire the cup together.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_pumel"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "q_pumel_done"
        },
        {
          "flag": "q_pumel_accepted"
        },
        {
          "flag": "q_pumel_prepared"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "e_pumel_cup"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "pumel_quest_ready",
      "speaker": "pumel",
      "kind": "quest",
      "text": "The broad base has had its trial, and we chose the finish together. It looks pleased with the ledge. I certainly am.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_pumel"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "q_pumel_done"
        },
        {
          "flag": "q_pumel_accepted"
        },
        {
          "flag": "q_pumel_prepared"
        },
        {
          "flag": "e_pumel_cup"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "That feels like a cup worth keeping.",
          "next": "pumel_quest_complete"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pumel_quest_complete",
      "speaker": "pumel",
      "kind": "quest",
      "text": "Please keep the broad-based cup as our little memento. I shall make another with the same good sense underneath.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_pumel"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "q_pumel_done"
        },
        {
          "flag": "q_pumel_accepted"
        },
        {
          "flag": "q_pumel_prepared"
        },
        {
          "flag": "e_pumel_cup"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [
        {
          "set_flag": "q_pumel_done",
          "value": true
        },
        {
          "give_item": "broad_based_cup"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pumel_quest_after",
      "speaker": "pumel",
      "kind": "quest",
      "text": "I am drawing more broad bases. Apparently a cup can be graceful without balancing on its smallest possible foot.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_pumel"
        },
        {
          "flag": "q_pumel_done"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "next": "pumel_quest_after_detail"
    },
    {
      "id": "pumel_quest_after_detail",
      "speaker": "pumel",
      "kind": "quest",
      "text": "The new drawings look rather like me standing in a queue. An unexpectedly useful reference.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_pumel"
        },
        {
          "flag": "q_pumel_done"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "pumel_relationship_acquaintance",
      "speaker": "pumel",
      "kind": "relationship",
      "text": "I usually learn a visitor's favorite cup before their favorite subject. We can begin with either.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_pumel"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "q_pumel_done"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "pumel_relationship_friend",
      "speaker": "pumel",
      "kind": "relationship",
      "text": "You stayed for the plain part underneath the glaze. I like having a friend who notices what makes things comfortable.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_pumel"
        },
        {
          "flag": "q_pumel_done"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "friend_pumel"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [
        {
          "set_flag": "friend_pumel",
          "value": true
        }
      ],
      "next": "pumel_relationship_friend_reply"
    },
    {
      "id": "pumel_relationship_friend_reply",
      "speaker": "pumel",
      "kind": "relationship",
      "text": "That earns you no chores. It earns you the right to tell me when my shelf is too high.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_pumel"
        },
        {
          "flag": "friend_pumel"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "pumel_relationship_friend_repeat",
      "speaker": "pumel",
      "kind": "relationship",
      "text": "I saved the warm side of the bench for you. No special occasion. The sun happened to be obliging.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_pumel"
        },
        {
          "flag": "friend_pumel"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "pumel_relationship_trusted",
      "speaker": "pumel",
      "kind": "relationship",
      "text": "At the gathering, I left a slightly uneven bowl on the table. Everyone used it. I think your company helped me let it stay.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_pumel"
        },
        {
          "flag": "friend_pumel"
        },
        {
          "flag": "m_festival_done"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "trusted_pumel"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [
        {
          "set_flag": "trusted_pumel",
          "value": true
        }
      ],
      "next": "pumel_relationship_trusted_reply"
    },
    {
      "id": "pumel_relationship_trusted_reply",
      "speaker": "pumel",
      "kind": "relationship",
      "text": "I would like you to see my unfinished things as well. Some of them are cups. Some are ideas about myself.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_pumel"
        },
        {
          "flag": "trusted_pumel"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "pumel_relationship_trusted_repeat",
      "speaker": "pumel",
      "kind": "relationship",
      "text": "An unfinished pot is allowed on this bench. So are you, if today feels like that.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_pumel"
        },
        {
          "flag": "trusted_pumel"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "pumel_festival_before",
      "speaker": "pumel",
      "kind": "festival",
      "text": "I can bring cups whenever the welcome is settled. Pots travel better when nobody expects them to hurry.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_pumel"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "m_agreement_done"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "m_festival_done"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "pumel_festival_ready_clear",
      "speaker": "pumel",
      "kind": "festival",
      "text": "Clear sky, sheltered tables ready. I will put the cups where ground visitors can reach them, even if balloons go up.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_pumel"
        },
        {
          "flag": "m_agreement_done"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "m_festival_done"
        },
        {
          "weather": "clear"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "pumel_festival_ready_rain",
      "speaker": "pumel",
      "kind": "festival",
      "text": "The cups are under the awning. Rain can have the saucers outside; everyone else gets a dry place at the table.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_pumel"
        },
        {
          "flag": "m_agreement_done"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "m_festival_done"
        },
        {
          "weather": "rain"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "pumel_festival_after",
      "speaker": "pumel",
      "kind": "festival",
      "text": "The cups came back in different groups, all with stories attached. I have never enjoyed washing up quite so much.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_pumel"
        },
        {
          "flag": "m_festival_done"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "pumel_idle_1",
      "speaker": "pumel",
      "kind": "idle",
      "text": "A thumb leaves a very honest mark in clay. Usually just where I meant to smooth it.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_pumel"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "pumel_idle_2",
      "speaker": "pumel",
      "kind": "idle",
      "text": "The terraces at home are cream and ochre. My apron is both, with a generous addition of lunch.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_pumel"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "pumel_idle_3",
      "speaker": "pumel",
      "kind": "idle",
      "text": "Brumlet has a good eye for a low cup. I used to ask if a handle looked right. Now I ask how it feels.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_pumel"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    }
  ]
}
